  ('cottage-weave', 'Cottage Weave', 'Carpet', 'Polypropylene tight loop', NULL, 'Heavy domestic / general commercial', ARRAY['Living', 'Bedroom', 'Stairs', 'Hall']::text[], ARRAY[4, 5]::double precision[], 'loop', ARRAY['#7F6955', '#604F40']::text[], '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave.jpg', 2, NULL, 'A tight-loop carpet with the natural texture of wool. It shrugs off stains, fading and everyday wear, which makes it a good choice for halls, stairs and living rooms.', 'Abingdon', 'Stainfree', ARRAY['Stain resistant', 'Bleach cleanable', 'Stainfree for Life Guarantee', 'Fade resistant', 'Hardwearing loop', '10 Year Wear Warranty', 'Made in Britain']::text[], ARRAY['Bark', 'Hazel', 'Dune', 'Desert', 'Latte', 'Caramel', 'Champagne', 'Savannah']::text[], ARRAY['/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/bark.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/hazel.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/dune.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/desert.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/latte.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/caramel.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/champagne.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/cottage-weave/savannah.jpg']::text[], 'https://www.abingdonflooring.co.uk/range/cottage-weave/', true),
