  ('dalesman', 'Dalesman', 'Carpet', 'Polypropylene chunky loop · 3-ply yarn', NULL, 'Heavy domestic / general commercial', ARRAY['Living', 'Bedroom', 'Stairs', 'Hall']::text[], ARRAY[4, 5]::double precision[], 'loop', ARRAY['#B2A38F', '#867A6C']::text[], '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman.jpg', 2, NULL, 'A chunky loop carpet woven from three-ply yarn for a cobbled texture. It comes in flecked berber shades or plain colours, and resists stains, fading and wear.', 'Abingdon', 'Stainfree', ARRAY['Stain resistant', 'Bleach cleanable', 'Stainfree for Life Guarantee', 'Fade resistant', 'Hardwearing loop', '10 Year Wear Warranty', 'Made in Britain']::text[], ARRAY['Skimming Stone', 'Pearled Ivory', 'White Swan', 'Eggshell', 'Almond Bisque', 'Sand Dollar', 'Cappuccino', 'Warm Taupe', 'Parchment', 'Creme', 'Fog', 'Mushroom', 'Sand', 'Sandshell']::text[], ARRAY['/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/skimming-stone.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/pearled-ivory.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/white-swan.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/eggshell.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/almond-bisque.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/sand-dollar.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/cappuccino.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/warm-taupe.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/parchment.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/creme.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/fog.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/mushroom.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/sand.jpg', '/ranges/abingdon/dalesman/sandshell.jpg']::text[], 'https://www.abingdonflooring.co.uk/range/dalesman/', true),
